  "Id": 110,
  "Title": "AKU tops HEC ranking for medical universities in 2015",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "AKU has maintained its position as the top medical university in Pakistan for the fifth time in a row in HEC ranking",
  "GlobalNews": true,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<div class=\"ExternalClass17C42D4C187C40348272BB3B43372409\"><div>\u200bThe Aga Khan University has been ranked as the top medical university in Pakistan in the <a href=\"http&#58;//hec.gov.pk/english/universities/Documents/Ranking_Doc%20%282015%29.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">ranking of Pakistani universities in 2015</a>, released by the Higher Education Commission \u2013 the primary regulatory body of higher education in the country.\u200b</div><div>&#160;</div><div>\u200bAKU was also ranked as the top private university and fifth of 129 public and private universities in different categories \u2013 including general, engineering and technology, business education, agriculture and veterinary, medicine, and arts and design.<br></div><div><br></div><div>Dr Mukhtar Ahmed, Chairman, HEC unveiled the ranking on February 23 in Islamabad.</div><div>&#160;</div><div>In the medical category, AKU was ranked as the best of 13 universities, including University of Health Sciences, Dow University of Health Sciences and Khyber Medical University.</div><div>&#160;</div><div>The parameters considered in a comprehensive selection process included quality assurance, teaching quality, research, finance and facilities, and social integration or community development.</div><div>&#160;</div></div><div class=\"ExternalClass17C42D4C187C40348272BB3B43372409\"><div><div>More details&#58; <a href=\"https&#58;//www.dawn.com/news/1241418\" target=\"_blank\">https&#58;//www.dawn.com/news/1241418</a></div><div>&#160;</div><div><em>News amended</em><br></div></div></div>",
